    transliteration: "tv\u0101m\u0101mananti munaya\u1e25 parama\u1e43 pum\u0101\u1e43sa- m\u0101dityavar\u1e47amamala\u1e43 tamasa\u1e25 parast\u0101t | tv\u0101meva samyagupalabhya jayanti m\u1e5btyu\u1e43 n\u0101nya\u1e25 \u015biva\u1e25 \u015bivapadasya mun\u012bndra panth\u0101\u1e25 ||",
    meaning: "Sages proclaim You to be the Supreme Person, luminous as the sun, pure and beyond all darkness. Having truly realized You alone do they conquer death; there is no other auspicious path to liberation, O Lord of Sages.",
