    transliteration: "tv\u0101mavyaya\u1e43 vibhumacintyamasa\u1e43khyam\u0101dya\u1e43 brahm\u0101\u1e47am\u012b\u015bvaramanantamana\u1e45gaketum | yog\u012b\u015bvara\u1e43 viditayogamanekameka\u1e43 j\u00f1\u0101nasvar\u016bpamamala\u1e43 pravadanti santa\u1e25 ||",
    meaning: "The wise declare You to be imperishable, all-pervading, inconceivable, limitless, primeval, Brahma, Ishvara, infinite, the conqueror of desire, supreme among yogis, knower of yoga, one yet manifest, pure consciousness and spotless.",
