    transliteration: "tubhya\u1e43 namastribhuvan\u0101rtihar\u0101ya n\u0101tha tubhya\u1e43 nama\u1e25 k\u1e63itital\u0101malabh\u016b\u1e63a\u1e47\u0101ya | tubhya\u1e43 namastrijagata\u1e25 parame\u015bvar\u0101ya tubhya\u1e43 namo jina bhavodadhi\u015bo\u1e63a\u1e47\u0101ya ||",
    meaning: "Salutations to You, O Lord, remover of the miseries of the three worlds! Salutations to You, spotless ornament of the earth! Salutations to You, Supreme Lord of the three realms! Salutations to You, O Jina, who driest up the ocean of mundane existence!",
    attribution: "Acharya Manatunga",
