    transliteration: "sarvopa\u015b\u0101ntadurita\u1e43 tava sa\u1e43stavena ceto yad\u0101 na kurute bhavabandhamuktam | tatki\u1e43 vicitramapi te gu\u1e47ak\u012brtanena mukto na mu\u00f1cati pad\u0101ni jana\u1e25 pad\u0101n\u0101m ||",
