    transliteration: "gambh\u012brat\u0101ravaradundubhin\u0101dap\u016bt\u0101\u1e25 sarvatra digvalayabh\u0101ji jan\u0101\u1e25 prav\u1e5btt\u0101\u1e25 | dharma\u1e43 vadantamakhila\u1e43 jinar\u0101jameta\u1e43 \u015brotu\u1e43 prah\u1e5b\u1e63\u1e6damanasa\u1e25 sahas\u0101 pray\u0101nti ||",
    meaning: "Consecrated by the deep, resonant vibrations of the divine dundubhi drum echoing across the horizon, people everywhere joyfully hasten to listen to the King of Jinas expounding the universal Dharma.",
