    transliteration: "divyadhvanirbhavati te vi\u015bad\u0101rthav\u0101cya\u1e25 sarvapramadyutikaro hitak\u1e5bt praj\u0101n\u0101m | ya\u1e25 sa\u1e43pravartayati bhavyajanaprabodha\u1e43 bh\u0101\u1e63\u0101svabh\u0101vasubhaga\u1e25 pratibodhahetu\u1e25 ||",
